7.Linked List vs Array?

Array                                   Linked List
index based	node based
random access possible 	no random access
arr[i]-> O(1)	ith node tak jana -> O(n)
fixed size traditionally	dynamic size
insertion/deletion middle mein expensive	easier agar reference ho toh

Contiguous memory concept 	nodes can be scattered in memory



