10. Doubly Linked List

Doubly mein node ke paas previous + data + next hota hai.

null ← 10 ⇄ 20 ⇄ 30 → null

Node:

┌──────────┬──────────┬──────────┐
│   prev   │   data   │   next   │
└──────────┴──────────┴──────────┘

Isse backward bhi traverse kar sakte hain.

